      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "For women, the childbearing period is a source of pain related to dysmenorrhoea, childbirth, abortion, gynaecological diseases, etc. Physiologically, female sex hormones influence pain modulation. Whatever its cause, appropriate evaluation and treatment should be offered to relieve these women."},
